<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore fuel oil stocks highest since May 1996.</title>
<headline>Singapore fuel oil stocks highest since May 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore fuel oil stocks rose to their highest level since May 1996, the latest data from the Trade Development Board (TDB) shows.</p>
<p>TDB said on Thursday that stocks of residue fuel oil totalled 12.299 million barrels, rising 1.974 million barrels in the week ended February 26.</p>
<p>That was highest on record since the week ending May 22, 1996 when stocks totalled 12.516 million barrels.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
